'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] [[:Category:Knives|knife]] obtainable using the Cauldron to combine [[Embersickle]] and [[Emberbow]] during the [[Halloween Event 2026]].

== Appearance ==
Taking the shape of a scythe, this item follows the purple and gold color scheme prominent throughout all Ember items. The handle is royal purple, and the joint between the handle and blade dons a purple and gold pumpkin head. Bowing out from the joint, the blade begins with purple roots and a gold interior, before ending on the classic steel grey tip seen in the other items. 

== Trivia ==

* This item matches with the [[Emberbow]] to create the Ancient Ember set.
* One of the first two [[Ancient Weapons|ancients]], the other being [[Emberbow]], to have a Chroma variant.
* Obtained through crafting [[Emberbow]] and [[Embersickle]] in the [[Halloween Event 2026#The Cauldron|Cauldron]], found in the lobby.
* This knife has a [[Chroma Emberscythe|chroma variant]] under the name [[Chroma Emberscythe]].
